3
00:00:05,708 --> 00:00:08,238
(Sheldon:)Thank you for letting
me come speak with you.

4
00:00:08,244 --> 00:00:09,874
(Bernadette:)Of course.

5
00:00:09,879 --> 00:00:12,009
(Sheldon:)As my relationships
with Penny and Amy

6
00:00:12,015 --> 00:00:14,085
(Sheldon:)are currently strained,
I'm turning to you

7
00:00:14,083 --> 00:00:15,983
(Sheldon:)for female comfort
and encouragement.

8
00:00:15,985 --> 00:00:17,515
Aww.

9
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:19,450
I'm honored.
I tried

10
00:00:19,455 --> 00:00:21,725
(Sheldon:)reaching out to my mother,
but she was in Bible study.

11
00:00:21,724 --> 00:00:23,594
(Sheldon:)Leonard's mother
is on a book tour.

12
00:00:23,593 --> 00:00:25,063
(Sheldon:)My Mee-Maw was taking a nap,

13
00:00:25,061 --> 00:00:28,031
(Sheldon:)and after a while Siri
started repeating her answers.

14
00:00:28,865 --> 00:00:31,535
(Bernadette:)So, I'm your seventh choice.

15
00:00:31,534 --> 00:00:34,774
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I know, top ten,
pretty exciting.

16
00:00:34,771 --> 00:00:37,301
(Bernadette:)How can I help you?

17
00:00:37,307 --> 00:00:39,207
(Sheldon:)Well, in addition
to Amy leaving me,

18
00:00:39,208 --> 00:00:41,308
(Sheldon:)Leonard's moving in with Penny.

19
00:00:41,311 --> 00:00:44,311
(Sheldon:)It's difficult
not to feel abandoned.

20
00:00:44,314 --> 00:00:47,584
(Bernadette:)Well, why don't you look at this
as an opportunity?

21
00:00:47,583 --> 00:00:49,813
(Bernadette:)You had other roommates
before Leonard.

22
00:00:49,819 --> 00:00:51,119
(Bernadette:)Maybe this is a chance

23
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,520
(Bernadette:)to find someone new.

24
00:00:52,522 --> 00:00:55,022
(Sheldon:)Perhaps I could find someone
better than Leonard.

25
00:00:55,024 --> 00:00:57,694
(Sheldon:)Someone I can rub in his face.

26
00:00:57,694 --> 00:01:01,024
(Sheldon:)Chris Pratt's
all the rage right now.

